ub.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/29/3832029/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"濡れた前髪のまま食べるワッフルの\n美味しさたるや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は両親だけでなく、\n親戚の方々も来てくれました\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"父の祖母の弟さんも来てくださり、\nなんと91歳！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮球場に来てくれた方の中で\n多分1番の高齢なのではないでしょうか！！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウムを持って、立ってノリノリで\n応援してくれていたそう...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくり( ;o; )( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい( ;o; )( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京オリンピックで\nサッカー銅メダルを獲得した大叔父も\n今日の応援に来てくれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るくて楽しい大叔父さんです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親戚の方にも喜んでもらえて\n楽しんでもらえて私は幸せです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それと同時に、\nもっと見えやすい位置にもいきたいな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと活躍しているところを\n見て欲しいな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","